"vndb:vn-staff:59073","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"Witch Hunt","creatorId":"vndb:s45130","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s45130","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s45130","name":"Witch Hunt","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:59074","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"Jayolite","creatorId":"vndb:s53878","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s53878","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s53878","name":"Jayolite","roleCode":"translator","roleLabel":"翻译","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:59075","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"Flo Perfecto","creatorId":"vndb:s53879","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s53879","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s53879","name":"Flo Perfecto","roleCode":"editor","roleLabel":"编辑","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:59076","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"竜騎士07","creatorId":"vndb:s7","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s7","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s7","name":"竜騎士07","roleCode":"chardesign","roleLabel":"角色设计","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:59078","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"竜騎士07","creatorId":"vndb:s7","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s7","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s7","name":"竜騎士07","roleCode":"director","roleLabel":"导演","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:59080","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c1340","characterName":"ベアトリーチェ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c1340"},"originalCharacterName":"ベアトリーチェ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1000"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1129"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Beatrice is the Golden and Endless Witch, and the primary antagonist of the series for the first four games. She is affectionately referred to as \"Beato\" (ベアト) starting in Banquet of the Golden Witch."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A witch who has lived for over a thousand years, she is said to appear as a cloud of golden butterflies, and has the power to summon higher demons among the 72 pillars to serve her. It is said that humans can summon her to have their wishes granted in exchange for compensation, though she often acts whimsically. She is the one rumored to have given Kinzo ten tons of gold and served under him as the alchemic advisor to the Ushiromiya family."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Her real identity is Yasuda Sayo, the child of Ushiromiya Kinzou and grandchild of Beatrice Castiglioni. According to Sayo, her Beatrice identity was only fully created on November 29, 1984, when she discovered her true identity and inherited the 10 tons of gold belonging to her grandmother; she also has the alternate personas Shannon and Kanon, with her alternative existence being Ushiromiya Lion."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Due to Natsuhi pushing the servant who was holding her from a cliff when she was a baby, she lost her sexual organ; however she got rescued by Genji and Nanjou, who hid her true identity, raising her as female and lowering her age by three years."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She is in love with Ushiromiya Battler, due to Shannon \"transferring\" her seed of love to her, yet she believes she is incapable of love due to her mutilated body."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1340"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/98/9844d5eff8672290605ae2a3a36fffeb076729b3904da46f96b41d1e6fb72ca6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8e/8e5778970c942c420d0de3db0ab6ec9df6892a77655a42f76b5a438f57d79cd5.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c196","characterName":"右代宮 戦人","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c196"},"originalCharacterName":"右代宮 戦人","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"18"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"715"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Battler is Rudolf's son. Although stubborn and hotheaded, he is a very compassionate young man. He tends to flirt with young women and has a perpetual fear of \"shaky\" transportation, thinking he may fall out of a plane or boat depending on the turbulence."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Due to his father's remarriage, Battler rebelled and went to live with his maternal grandparents for the next six years, cutting all ties to the Ushiromiya family. After his grandparents' deaths, he returned to his family, though he had not fully reconciled with his father."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c196"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3a/3af7f8f01cccdc48719d02e5e4aa4866781d3fc4da937628ac06f478b6619388.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dc/dc8d350c34eca712e872b309c94b9c2d7520ba0c5b22e771f0bde2e26067de40.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c197","characterName":"右代宮 朱志香","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c197"},"originalCharacterName":"右代宮 朱志香","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"18"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"825"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Krauss and Natsuhi's daughter. Although Jessica is the heiress of the Ushiromiya family after her father, she is an energetic and tomboyish young woman who lacks the more refined behavior expected of such a role. Due to her rebellious nature, she is resentful of her parents for the pressures they place on her regarding the family headship, but still shows concern for them."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a habit of faking asthma attacks as a means of escaping from tense situations. She has a crush on the servant Kanon."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is also proficient in the use of brass knuckles."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c197"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/11/11886aa1c2e074d0a1278497c93b7b9dd7c99caa6a871eb3a2f8f4c25a0e4ed9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4b/4b3a6f189a9e6acf5bf5afed1d2fb791e45d16fc2e5c710b051d3b8fb4ae20d1.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c198","characterName":"右代宮 譲治","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c198"},"originalCharacterName":"右代宮 譲治","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"23"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"316"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Eva and Hideyoshi's son. He is the oldest of Kinzou's grandchildren, and an exceptional and diligent young adult. He was brought up by Eva specifically with the family headship in mind, works at his father's company as an apprentice, and is a skilled martial artist like his mother. He respects his parents greatly, though he admittedly finds his mother overbearing."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"George is admired by everyone in his family, especially his cousins, who view him as their older brother and peacemaker."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c198"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/90/907ab6263fb12ac230c6c0d6190485b3fb56ba724dd0f754239fe470e537cbfb.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a8/a8a1007fb0772d74245a5b58bf69155be3d3b51615bda97f09118a50e17f74c6.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c199","characterName":"右代宮 真里亞","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c199"},"originalCharacterName":"右代宮 真里亞","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"9"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"329"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"weight":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"28"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Maria is Rosa's daughter. She has a long-standing habit of uttering \"uuuu\" (うーうー) whenever excited or upset. She is very honest and naïve, as shown by her tendency to easily believe lies and take jokes very seriously. While she loves her mother, Maria subconsciously resents that Rosa's long and frequent absences have made her lonely and wishes Rosa would spend more time with her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Having no interest in friends or studies, Maria has an extensive knowledge of the occult."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c199"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/74/74f9fedd357662ea745ef02c3aa6ce1c144a4ad5ebefd44879f21c35ca4261d6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/dd/dd31e154fd9b0207758d8ad84eba4fb947d5b446b6b1640bede5a088e8d65a2a.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c202","characterName":"紗音","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c202"},"originalCharacterName":"紗音","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"16"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"525"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Shannon is a young maid of Kinzou's mansion. She has a habit of making mistakes and blunders when she is nervous, despite being an extremely talented and hardworking servant."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She thinks of Kanon as her younger brother and like him, she feels she is inferior to humans, as she is only furniture. Despite this, she has fallen in love with George; Shannon's main story revolves around her love and engagement to him."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"In her childhood, she fell in love with Battler, when the latter made a promise to marry her. Shannon believed him and waited for him. But her heart broke when Battler sent a letter to all the cousins except her. Shannon \"transferred\" her love of Battler to Beatrice, representing Sayo hiding her love for Battler deep within her so that she can move on."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c202"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5b/5b9978f26dda5e2017e84e155a5401e25dd067f61b7db9e8650e387e460db10b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bd/bda9a5361b3230e8a2434aaf29f4fe5856665b4e9cf32921eb44e98dfc6dcc30.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c205","characterName":"嘉音","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c205"},"originalCharacterName":"嘉音","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"16"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1006"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kanon is a young servant of Kinzou's mansion. He is a serious and fervent servant, carrying out his master's orders thoroughly."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is a bit frail and antisocial. Kanon thinks of Shannon as his elder sister and highly disapproves of her feelings for George, as he believes she should not feel love as she is only furniture. He also denies any human emotions in himself because he thinks of himself as only furniture. This brought problems to him later since he has a crush on Jessica."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Wikipedia"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c205"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/88/88080808df67bdf05f90e089a874905